        "name": "apps",
        "type": "[App!]",
        "args": [
          {
            "name": "appType",
            "type": "[AppType!]",
            "default": null
          },
          {
            "name": "filter",
            "type": "AppFilter",
            "default": null
          }
        ],
        "description": "The apps this file carries, across the app_files m2m. Usually one; more for\na multicontent bundle. Admin only, and only hydrated under the top-level\n`files` query.\n\nUnlike `Title.apps` this takes no `owned` argument: an app is owned exactly\nwhen it has files, so everything reachable from a file is owned by\nconstruction and the filter could only ever return all of them or none.\n`filter: {owned: ...}` is still accepted here - the input type is shared with\n`Title.apps` - and is subject to the same tautology."
      }
    ]
